{"title":"Career Roadmap: Airline Reservation Executive","role":"Airline Reservation Executive","summary":"An Airline Reservation Executive manages passenger booking and travel-related services for airlines, airports, travel companies or airline support organizations.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (General / Honours)","Course":"Aviation (Hons) / Airport Ground Handling"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Build expertise in airline reservations, ticketing, fares, passenger service, GDS systems, travel documentation and airline operations"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"An Airline Reservation Executive manages passenger booking and travel-related services for airlines, airports, travel companies or airline support organizations."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Flight reservations"},{"text":"Ticket issuance"},{"text":"Booking modifications"},{"text":"Cancellations and refunds"},{"text":"Fare quotation"},{"text":"Passenger information"},{"text":"Seat selection"},{"text":"Special service requests"},{"text":"Itinerary management"},{"text":"Travel-document verification"},{"text":"Customer support"},{"text":"Coordination with airport/airline teams"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Airline Operations","Reservation Systems","GDS","Fare Knowledge","Customer Service","Communication","Travel Documentation"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof of Skill","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Aviation and travel fundamentals"},{"text":"Airline operations, geography, communication"},{"text":"Aviation case studies"},{"text":"Only theoretical aviation knowledge"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Reservations + ticketing"},{"text":"GDS, PNR, fares, schedules"},{"text":"Reservation simulations"},{"text":"Not learning GDS"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Passenger service + international travel"},{"text":"Ticketing, disruptions, documentation"},{"text":"Practical booking exercises"},{"text":"Weak customer-service skills"}],[{"text":"Year 4*"},{"text":"Advanced airline operations"},{"text":"Revenue concepts, analytics, CRM"},{"text":"Internship + capstone"},{"text":"No airport/airline exposure"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"*Applicable where the B.Sc. program is four years."}]},{"heading":"Semester-by-Semester Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Semester 1"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Introduction to aviation"},{"text":"Airline industry structure"},{"text":"Airport operations"},{"text":"Aviation terminology"},{"text":"Geography"},{"text":"World time zones"},{"text":"Professional communication"},{"text":"Customer-service fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 2"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Passenger handling"},{"text":"Airline schedules"},{"text":"Airport codes"},{"text":"Aircraft basics"},{"text":"Travel documentation"},{"text":"Reservation fundamentals"},{"text":"Aviation safety awareness"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 3"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airline reservation systems"},{"text":"PNR creation"},{"text":"Passenger name records"},{"text":"Flight availability"},{"text":"Seat inventory"},{"text":"Fare classes"},{"text":"Ticketing basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 4"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GDS fundamentals"},{"text":"Fare rules"},{"text":"Ticket changes"},{"text":"Cancellations"},{"text":"Refunds"},{"text":"Reissues"},{"text":"Baggage concepts"},{"text":"Special service requests"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 5"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"International ticketing"},{"text":"Multi-sector itineraries"},{"text":"Connections"},{"text":"Codeshare concepts"},{"text":"Interline concepts"},{"text":"Travel documentation"},{"text":"Customer complaint handling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 6"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airline revenue management basics"},{"text":"CRM"},{"text":"Disruption management"},{"text":"Airport coordination"},{"text":"Airline sales"},{"text":"Travel agency operations"},{"text":"Internship preparation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 7–8, if applicable"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced reservation operations"},{"text":"Airline analytics"},{"text":"Customer-experience management"},{"text":"Aviation technology"},{"text":"Capstone"},{"text":"Airline/airport internship"}]}]},{"heading":"Aviation Industry Fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand the relationship between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Airline","Airport","Passenger","Travel Agent","GDS","Ground Handler","Immigration/Customs","Security"]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the difference between:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airline"},{"text":"Airport operator"},{"text":"Ground handling company"},{"text":"Travel agency"},{"text":"Online travel agency"},{"text":"GDS provider"},{"text":"Cargo operator"},{"text":"Aviation regulator"}]}]},{"heading":"Airport & Airline Codes","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Memorize commonly used aviation coding concepts."},{"type":"h","text":"IATA Codes"},{"type":"p","text":"Examples:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"DEL — Delhi"},{"text":"BOM — Mumbai"},{"text":"HYD — Hyderabad"},{"text":"BLR — Bengaluru"},{"text":"MAA — Chennai"},{"text":"DXB — Dubai"},{"text":"SIN — Singapore"},{"text":"LHR — London Heathrow"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"IATA airport codes"},{"text":"Airline codes"},{"text":"City codes"},{"text":"Airport vs metropolitan/city codes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"ICAO"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the purpose of ICAO codes and how they differ from IATA codes."}]},{"heading":"Airline Reservation Systems","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A core skill is learning how computerized reservation systems work."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Flight availability"},{"text":"Booking classes"},{"text":"Passenger profiles"},{"text":"PNR creation"},{"text":"Passenger details"},{"text":"Seat assignment"},{"text":"Ticketing"},{"text":"Itinerary"},{"text":"Remarks"},{"text":"Special service requests"},{"text":"Queue concepts"},{"text":"Booking changes"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Common GDS ecosystems include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Amadeus"},{"text":"Sabre"},{"text":"Travelport"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Exact system usage depends on the employer."}]},{"heading":"PNR","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand the Passenger Name Record (PNR) as the booking record containing relevant reservation information."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical information can include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Passenger name"},{"text":"Flight segments"},{"text":"Dates"},{"text":"Contact information"},{"text":"Ticket information"},{"text":"Seat information"},{"text":"Special requests"},{"text":"Booking status"},{"text":"Remarks"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the complete workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Search","Availability","Select Flight","Passenger Details","Booking","PNR","Ticketing","Confirmation"]}]},{"heading":"Fare Classes & Inventory","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cabin classes"},{"text":"Booking classes"},{"text":"Fare families"},{"text":"Fare basis"},{"text":"Inventory availability"},{"text":"Fare restrictions"},{"text":"Advance-purchase requirements"},{"text":"Minimum/maximum stay"},{"text":"Change penalties"},{"text":"Cancellation conditions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not confuse:"},{"type":"p","text":"Cabin class with booking class."},{"type":"p","text":"Different booking classes can exist within the same cabin."}]},{"heading":"Ticketing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"E-ticket concepts"},{"text":"Ticket numbers"},{"text":"Itineraries"},{"text":"Fare calculation"},{"text":"Taxes"},{"text":"Fees"},{"text":"Ancillaries"},{"text":"Reissue"},{"text":"Revalidation"},{"text":"Refund"},{"text":"Cancellation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the difference between:"},{"type":"h","text":"Reissue"},{"type":"p","text":"Changing an existing ticket and issuing updated ticket information according to applicable rules."},{"type":"h","text":"Refund"},{"type":"p","text":"Returning eligible ticket value according to fare rules and applicable policies."}]},{"heading":"Fare Rules","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to interpret:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Change penalties"},{"text":"Cancellation penalties"},{"text":"No-show rules"},{"text":"Refundability"},{"text":"Date changes"},{"text":"Route changes"},{"text":"Name corrections"},{"text":"Advance-purchase rules"},{"text":"Minimum stay"},{"text":"Maximum stay"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Never give a customer a definitive refund or change amount without checking the current fare rules and airline policy."}]},{"heading":"International Travel","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn the fundamentals of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Passports"},{"text":"Visas"},{"text":"Transit visas"},{"text":"Entry requirements"},{"text":"Health documentation"},{"text":"Travel insurance"},{"text":"Immigration"},{"text":"Customs"},{"text":"Connection requirements"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Important distinction:"},{"type":"p","text":"Reservation staff can provide or verify available travel information, but immigration authorities and destination governments determine entry eligibility."},{"type":"p","text":"Requirements can change, so current official sources should be checked before travel."}]},{"heading":"Passenger Service","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop strong skills in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Greeting"},{"text":"Listening"},{"text":"Requirement identification"},{"text":"Booking assistance"},{"text":"Clear explanations"},{"text":"Complaint handling"},{"text":"Disruption communication"},{"text":"Escalation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Common customer situations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Flight cancellation"},{"text":"Flight delay"},{"text":"Missed connection"},{"text":"Schedule change"},{"text":"Seat issue"},{"text":"Baggage concern"},{"text":"Refund request"},{"text":"Name correction"},{"text":"Travel-document problem"}]}]},{"heading":"Special Service Requests","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand common passenger service categories such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Wheelchair assistance"},{"text":"Unaccompanied minors"},{"text":"Special meals"},{"text":"Medical assistance"},{"text":"Infant travel"},{"text":"Pregnant passengers"},{"text":"Assistance for elderly passengers"},{"text":"Special baggage"},{"text":"Sports equipment"},{"text":"Pets/animals where permitted"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Exact eligibility, documentation and airline procedures vary."}]},{"heading":"Disruption Management","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to support passengers during:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Delays"},{"text":"Cancellations"},{"text":"Missed connections"},{"text":"Schedule changes"},{"text":"Aircraft changes"},{"text":"Overbooking situations"},{"text":"Weather disruptions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Basic process:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Identify disruption","Check passenger itinerary","Review airline options","Rebook according to policy","Communicate clearly","Confirm updated itinerary"]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not promise compensation or accommodation unless the applicable airline policy authorizes it."}]},{"heading":"Baggage Fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cabin baggage"},{"text":"Checked baggage"},{"text":"Baggage allowance"},{"text":"Excess baggage"},{"text":"Special baggage"},{"text":"Sports equipment"},{"text":"Fragile items"},{"text":"Lost baggage"},{"text":"Delayed baggage"},{"text":"Damaged baggage"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the concept of baggage tracing and the role of airline/airport baggage systems."}]},{"heading":"Airline Customer Relationship Management","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how airlines manage:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Passenger profiles"},{"text":"Loyalty programs"},{"text":"Travel history"},{"text":"Preferences"},{"text":"Service requests"},{"text":"Complaints"},{"text":"Customer communication"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Passenger Data","Segmentation","Personalization","Service","Loyalty"]},{"type":"p","text":"Follow applicable privacy and data-security requirements when handling passenger information."}]},{"heading":"Airline Revenue Fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Reservation executives should understand basic commercial concepts."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Seat inventory"},{"text":"Load factor"},{"text":"Yield"},{"text":"Revenue passenger kilometres"},{"text":"Available seat kilometres"},{"text":"Revenue management"},{"text":"Dynamic pricing"},{"text":"Fare classes"},{"text":"Ancillary revenue"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the basic principle:"},{"type":"h","text":"Limited seat inventory + variable demand → Dynamic pricing and inventory management"}]},{"heading":"Travel Geography","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop strong knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Major airports"},{"text":"Major cities"},{"text":"International regions"},{"text":"Time zones"},{"text":"Flight routes"},{"text":"Hub airports"},{"text":"Connecting airports"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UTC"},{"text":"Local time"},{"text":"Daylight-saving concepts"},{"text":"Date-line concepts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Time-zone errors can create serious itinerary problems."}]},{"heading":"Customer Communication","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Verbal"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Professional English"},{"text":"Telephone etiquette"},{"text":"Clear explanations"},{"text":"Active listening"},{"text":"Conflict management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Written"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Email"},{"text":"Booking confirmations"},{"text":"Itinerary communication"},{"text":"Refund communication"},{"text":"Disruption notifications"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Additional Indian and international languages can be advantageous depending on the employer and passenger market."}]},{"heading":"Digital & Data Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Essential"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Word"},{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Email"},{"text":"CRM systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL basics"},{"text":"Python basics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential dashboards:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Booking volume"},{"text":"Cancellation rate"},{"text":"No-show rate"},{"text":"Customer complaints"},{"text":"Refund turnaround"},{"text":"Revenue by route"},{"text":"Passenger-service metrics"}]}]},{"heading":"Projects to Build","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Airline Reservation Simulator"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a simulated reservation workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Search","Availability","Passenger Details","PNR","Seat","Fare","Ticket","Confirmation"]},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Flight inventory"},{"text":"Passenger details"},{"text":"Booking classes"},{"text":"Fare calculation"},{"text":"Seat selection"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Flight Disruption Management System"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a case-management system for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Delays"},{"text":"Cancellations"},{"text":"Rebooking"},{"text":"Missed connections"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Passenger"},{"text":"Booking"},{"text":"Original flight"},{"text":"New flight"},{"text":"Reason"},{"text":"Status"},{"text":"Resolution"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Airline Booking Analytics Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a dashboard containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bookings"},{"text":"Routes"},{"text":"Cabin class"},{"text":"Load factor"},{"text":"Cancellation"},{"text":"No-show"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Customer complaints"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel + Power BI"}]},{"heading":"Advanced Capstone Project","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Smart Airline Reservation & Passenger Service Platform"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a simulated system combining:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Reservation","PNR","Ticketing","CRM","Analytics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Features:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Flight search"},{"text":"Seat inventory"},{"text":"PNR management"},{"text":"Fare calculation"},{"text":"Ticket records"},{"text":"Passenger profiles"},{"text":"Special-service requests"},{"text":"Disruption management"},{"text":"Refund workflow"},{"text":"Customer-service dashboard"}]},{"type":"p","text":"AI can assist with itinerary recommendations and customer-service classification, but actual ticketing, refunds and regulatory/travel eligibility decisions should remain subject to authorized systems and staff."}]},{"heading":"Specialization Options","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Specialization","Additional Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Airline Reservations"},{"text":"GDS, ticketing, fares"}],[{"text":"Airline Ticketing"},{"text":"Fare rules, reissue, refunds"}],[{"text":"Passenger Services"},{"text":"Airport operations, customer service"}],[{"text":"Travel Agency Operations"},{"text":"GDS, itinerary planning"}],[{"text":"Corporate Travel"},{"text":"Business travel, policy"}],[{"text":"International Ticketing"},{"text":"Global fares, travel documentation"}],[{"text":"Airline Sales"},{"text":"B2B sales, distribution"}],[{"text":"Revenue Management"},{"text":"Pricing, forecasting"}],[{"text":"Airline CRM"},{"text":"Customer data, loyalty"}],[{"text":"Travel Technology"},{"text":"APIs, reservation systems"}],[{"text":"Aviation Analytics"},{"text":"SQL, Python, Power BI"}],[{"text":"Airport Ground Operations"},{"text":"Passenger handling, turnaround"}]]}]},{"heading":"Software & Systems","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Reservation/GDS"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Amadeus"},{"text":"Sabre"},{"text":"Travelport"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Office"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Word"},{"text":"PowerPoint"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Tableau"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Customer Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CRM systems"},{"text":"Airline customer-service platforms"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The student should ideally obtain hands-on practice in at least one GDS, rather than only studying reservation theory."}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airlines"},{"text":"Airport operators"},{"text":"Ground-handling companies"},{"text":"Travel agencies"},{"text":"Corporate travel companies"},{"text":"Online travel agencies"},{"text":"GDS/travel-technology companies"},{"text":"Aviation service companies"},{"text":"Airport customer-service departments"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship Deliverables"},{"type":"p","text":"Try to gain experience with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reservation systems"},{"text":"Passenger handling"},{"text":"Ticketing"},{"text":"Fare rules"},{"text":"Customer service"},{"text":"Flight disruptions"},{"text":"Travel documentation"},{"text":"Airport operations"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Useful supplementary areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Amadeus training"},{"text":"Sabre training"},{"text":"Travelport training"},{"text":"Airline reservation"},{"text":"Airline ticketing"},{"text":"Travel & tourism"},{"text":"Customer service"},{"text":"Aviation operations"},{"text":"Airport ground handling"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"CRM"}]},{"type":"p","text":"GDS certification is useful, but actual hands-on system experience is particularly valuable."}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Careers","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Possible roles include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airline Reservation Executive"},{"text":"Reservation Agent"},{"text":"Airline Ticketing Executive"},{"text":"Passenger Service Executive"},{"text":"Airline Customer Service Executive"},{"text":"Travel Consultant"},{"text":"Ticketing Executive"},{"text":"Airline Sales Executive"},{"text":"Reservation Associate"},{"text":"Travel Desk Executive"},{"text":"Corporate Travel Executive"},{"text":"GDS Reservation Associate"},{"text":"Airport Customer Service Executive"},{"text":"Airline Support Executive"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential pathways:"},{"type":"h","text":"Aviation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Sc Aviation Management"},{"text":"Aviation Management"},{"text":"Airport Management"},{"text":"Airline Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tourism & Travel"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBA/MTA Tourism Management"},{"text":"Travel Management"},{"text":"Tourism Administration"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBA Marketing"},{"text":"MBA Operations"},{"text":"MBA International Business"},{"text":"MBA Logistics & Supply Chain"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"Data Analytics"},{"text":"Aviation Analytics"}]}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential postgraduate areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airline Management"},{"text":"Aviation Management"},{"text":"Airport Management"},{"text":"Air Transport Management"},{"text":"International Tourism Management"},{"text":"Travel Management"},{"text":"Aviation Business"},{"text":"Aviation Analytics"},{"text":"Airline Revenue Management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential markets include the UK, UAE, Singapore, Australia, Canada, Europe and other major aviation hubs. Employment and work-authorization rules should be checked for the destination country."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"0–2 Years"},{"type":"flow","items":["Reservation Executive","Senior Reservation Executive","Reservation Associate"]},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GDS"},{"text":"Ticketing"},{"text":"Fare rules"},{"text":"Customer service"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2–5 Years"},{"type":"flow","items":["Senior Reservation Executive","Reservation Supervisor","Ticketing Supervisor"]},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Complex itineraries"},{"text":"International ticketing"},{"text":"Team coordination"},{"text":"Escalation handling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5–8 Years"},{"type":"flow","items":["Reservation Manager","Ticketing Manager","Passenger Services Manager"]},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Operations"},{"text":"Quality"},{"text":"Staff management"},{"text":"Customer experience"},{"text":"Revenue coordination"}]},{"type":"h","text":"8+ Years"},{"type":"p","text":"Possible directions:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airline Reservations Manager"},{"text":"Passenger Services Manager"},{"text":"Airport Operations Manager"},{"text":"Travel Operations Manager"},{"text":"Airline Sales Manager"},{"text":"Revenue Management Specialist"},{"text":"Distribution Manager"},{"text":"Aviation Operations Consultant"}]}]},{"heading":"Long-Term Relevance: 2030–2046","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Airline reservations are becoming increasingly automated through:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mobile booking"},{"text":"AI travel assistants"},{"text":"Dynamic pricing"},{"text":"Self-service systems"},{"text":"Automated rebooking"},{"text":"Digital identity"},{"text":"Personalized offers"},{"text":"Chatbots"},{"text":"NDC/API-based distribution"},{"text":"Predictive disruption management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Therefore, basic ticketing work may become increasingly automated."},{"type":"p","text":"The stronger long-term profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["GDS","Complex Ticketing","Customer Service","Revenue Management","Travel Technology","Analytics"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Airline Operations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airport operations"},{"text":"Airline schedules"},{"text":"Passenger handling"},{"text":"Disruption management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Reservations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GDS"},{"text":"PNR"},{"text":"Fare classes"},{"text":"Ticketing"},{"text":"Reissue"},{"text":"Refund"},{"text":"Ancillaries"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Travel"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Geography"},{"text":"Time zones"},{"text":"Travel documentation"},{"text":"International itinerary planning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Customer Service"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Complaint handling"},{"text":"Service recovery"},{"text":"Cross-cultural communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"CRM"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Basic Python"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue management"},{"text":"NDC concepts"},{"text":"Airline APIs"},{"text":"Travel technology"},{"text":"Data analytics"}]}]},{"heading":"Final Portfolio Target","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should ideally have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airline reservation simulation"},{"text":"PNR and ticketing casebook"},{"text":"International itinerary planning project"},{"text":"Flight disruption management system"},{"text":"Airline booking analytics dashboard"},{"text":"GDS practical training"},{"text":"Travel-documentation case studies"},{"text":"Customer-service casebook"},{"text":"Airline/airport internship"},{"text":"Professional aviation operations portfolio"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Graduate Profile"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Sc. Aviation/Airport Ground Handling → Aviation Fundamentals → Airport Operations → Reservation Systems → GDS → PNR → Fare Rules → Ticketing → International Travel → Passenger Service → Disruption Management → CRM → Analytics → Internship → Airline Reservation Executive → Senior Reservation Executive → Reservation/Ticketing Supervisor → Reservation Manager/Airline Operations Manager."}]}]}